"Not" is not the same as "opposite."  "not good" doesn't mean "evil" or 
"bad", and "not hot" doesn't mean "cold."

Esperantists deal with this all the time, since their prefix for 
opposite, "mal-", is very productive, and they also use the "not" prefix 
a lot.

